type: software
title: "agent-based-modeling: A Claude Code skill for ABM"
abstract: >
  A Claude Code skill that encodes the academic state of practice for
  agent-based modeling: the ODD documentation standard, pattern-oriented
  modeling, calibration/verification/validation discipline, sensitivity
  analysis, and known failure modes. Includes runnable Mesa and SALib
  templates, reference files, and an eval harness.
